            <tr style="height:66.6500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;background:rgb(255,255,255);">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><ol start="1">
<li>
<p><strong>理论讲授&nbsp;</strong>系统讲解物理化学核心理论，结合药学应用案例（如药物溶解度预测、制剂稳定性分析），采用启发式教学，通过课堂提问与讨论提升学生参与度。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>问题导向学习（PBL）</strong>分组研讨药学实际问题（如药物降解动力学、药物提取），引导学生运用物理化学原理提出解决方案，培养问题分析与团队协作能力。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>实验教学&nbsp;</strong>开设基础与综合实验，强化仪器操作与数据处理的规范化训练。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>数字化工具辅助&nbsp;</strong>利用elearning等数字化教学辅助平台分享课件和学习资料，并与学生互动和答疑。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>过程性评价&nbsp;</strong>通过随堂测试、实验报告及可课外作业等多维度考核，动态反馈学习成效，针对性调整教学策略。</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p><strong>Lectures</strong><br>Systematically explain core theories of physical chemistry, integrated with pharmaceutical application cases (e.g., drug solubility prediction, formulation stability analysis). Employ heuristic teaching methods to enhance student engagement through in-class questioning and discussions.</p>
<p><strong>Problem-Based Learning (PBL)</strong><br>Organize group discussions on practical pharmaceutical issues (e.g., drug degradation kinetics, drug extraction). Guide students to propose solutions using physicochemical principles, fostering problem-solving skills and teamwork.</p>
<p><strong>Laboratory Training</strong><br>Conduct fundamental and comprehensive experiments to strengthen standardized training in instrument operation and data processing.</p>
<p><strong>Digital Tool Support</strong><br>Utilize elearning platforms and other digital teaching aids to share course materials and learning resources, while facilitating interaction and Q&A with students.</p>
<p><strong>Process-Based Assessment</strong><br>Implement multi-dimensional evaluations, including pop quizzes, lab reports, and extracurricular assignments, to provide dynamic feedback on learning outcomes and enable targeted teaching adjustments.</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                    <p class=MsoNormal><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:22.4500pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
